# Secrets — never commit
.env
.env.*
# Both templates are committed and contain no secrets. Without these
# negations the `.env.*` rule above swallows them and neither ships.
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
*.orig
**/client_secrets.json
**/google-ads*.yaml

