docs/legacy/
docs/audit/

# Cut-over leftovers
*.pre-cutover

# DESIGN.md, PRODUCT-DESIGN.md and ORCHESTRATION.md were ignored here because
# they named the commercial product this was adapted from. They were rewritten
# for a public audience on 2026-09-05 and are now published on purpose: about
# twenty source comments cite them as the contract they implement, and a
# published repo whose comments point at missing files is worse than one that
# ships the files. PLAN.md and BUILD-PLAN.md were dated scoping and are gone.

# Development screenshots, still filenamed after the predecessor and taken
# before the rebrand -- they no longer match the UI.
docs/screenshots/

# Internal audit artifacts, dated working notes and pre-launch registers. All
# of these were deleted on 2026-09-05 -- the registers catalogued unfixed
# vulnerabilities by file and line, and the session notes recorded how a fix was
# reached rather than anything a reader of this repo needs. The patterns stay so
# that a new one is not committed by reflex; docs/ is deliberately NOT ignored
# wholesale, so a doc written for users can still be added.
docs/ISSUE-REGISTER-*.md
docs/PRELAUNCH-AUDIT-*.md
docs/TRACKER-TASKS-*.md
docs/REACT18-SHADCN-MIGRATION-*.md
docs/SESSION-RECORD-*.md
docs/SESSION-REPORT-*.md
docs/VERIFICATION-*.md
docs/UI-ISSUES-*.md
docs/GRID-FIX-*.md
docs/DASHBOARD-CLARITY-*.md
docs/ENGINE-WINDOW-*.md
docs/LANDING-AUTH-*.md
docs/MULTI-COUNTRY-*.md
docs/PLANNER-DEADCODE-*.md
docs/AI-OVERVIEW-*.md
docs/PLAN.md
docs/BUILD-PLAN.md
docs/superpowers/


# Runtime competitor maps written per-group by the engine via comppage.
# The curated filter_domain_list.json beside them is tracked; these are not.
backend/competitor/ai_files/domains/
backend/competitor/ai_files/keys/
.gitnexus

# Collected Django static. STATIC_ROOT is backend/static (tracker/settings.py:111),
# so `collectstatic` writes django.contrib.admin's and DRF's own assets here --
# 3.9MB of vendored build output that does not belong in the repo. The dev stack
# never needed it: runserver under DEBUG serves those files from the installed
# packages. Run collectstatic as a deploy step instead.
#
# backend/static/uploads/ is NOT build output -- it is the mail and PDF logo,
# hand-placed inside STATIC_ROOT, and it stays tracked. `collectstatic --clear`
# would delete it.
backend/static/admin/
backend/static/rest_framework/

# Agent tooling and planning. Useful while building this, not part of what the
# project ships: `.claude/` and `AGENTS.md` configure coding agents, `CLAUDE.md`
# is instructions to one, and `openspec/` holds the change proposals behind the
# work. A reader of this repository needs README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md and docs/.
.claude/
openspec/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
